SOAPBOX: Had to limit my participation due to family health issues but still had a ball in my favorite contest! I was a bit rusty and started slow but got into contest shape fairly quickly. although I'm running all homebrewed wire antennas I was able to have a few sustained runs when the rate meter hit 100 per hour! Thanks to all who worked me and or heard me, particularly the Dexpiditions. Looking forward to next year but we recently moved into a 55+ development so I'm unsure where I'll be operating from. 73, K2SE
